{
  "_comment": [
    "Civic issue taxonomy: the label space of the image classifier and the ONLY place where an",
    "issue code is mapped to a complaint category. Department and SLA are NOT defined here: they are",
    "read at request time from the category master (DB tables `categories` / `departments`), so",
    "department re-assignments and SLA changes never require touching the ML model or this file.",
    "",
    "Fields:",
    "  code            Stable identifier emitted by the ML model. Never rename; add new codes instead.",
    "  kind            'issue' (selectable civic issue) or 'reject' (model's 'not a civic issue' class).",
    "  name_en/name_mr Citizen-facing issue names.",
    "  category_id     Backend category (categories.id) this issue files under. Corporations created from",
    "                  the platform template use '<CORP>_<category_id>' and are resolved automatically.",
    "  corporation_overrides  Optional {corporation_id: category_id} when a tenant uses different ids.",
    "  app_category_id Category id in the citizen web app's local category list (src/data/mockData.ts).",
    "                  Bridge until the web app loads categories from /api/v1/master/categories."
  ],
